{"version":1,"content":"<p>在長期執掌英偉達的黃仁勳離職後，這家晶片巨頭的臨時行政總裁Colette Kress周三在員工大會上重申了對公司的信心。據一名與會人士透露，Kress對員工表示：「我們能應對」，這是她在周二的業績電話會後再次這麼説。面對外界要求黃仁勳復職的呼聲，這家晶片製造商也明確表示，這位聯合創始人兼前行政總裁不會回歸。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587036.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:32.431857+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:57:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_hash":"b04b266dabdfd5d9cc1fb25db39c72d277324f842e9e99a16ae430140aaf92d4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}